 shots. 9 Ball, 8 Ball, UK 8 Ball, and Snooker games are included as well as a choice of cues and a customizable table. \n\nOnline play against your friends requires an internet connection.\nVoice chat between players requires permission to use the device's microphone.", "short_description": "The sequel to the popular Cueist pool and snooker game, Cueist 2 gives a relaxing environment to play pool and snooker against your friends or AI opponents of increasing skill. A natural cueing action provides realistic spin, jump and swerve shots. 9 Ball, 8 Ball, UK 8 Ball, and Snooker games are included as well as a choice of cues and a customizable table. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.saitarasoft.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Saitara Software", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.saitarasoft.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "303736565051100"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "7422605814476487", "version": "1.17"}, "id": "684780659564038", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_o